OL,3,CPara-swimmer Ela Letton-Jones secures
OL,4,CWales' first medal in Commonwealth
OL,5,Cdebut
OL,7,FIn her Commonwealth debut, Welsh para-
OL,8,Fswimmer Ela Letton-Jones wins silver
OL,9,Fin the women's S13 100m freestyle race.
OL,11,FThe 19-year-old secured second place
OL,12,Fin a time of one minute, 4.30 seconds
OL,13,Fbehind Australian Jenna Jones, who won
OL,14,Fin 1:03.89.
OL,16,FIt follows the same result as the
OL,17,Fmorning session, where Letton-Jones
OL,18,Fqualified second fastest.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/3
