PN,43302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1785073676
OL,3,CPara-swimmer Ela Letton-Jones secures
OL,4,CWales' first medal in Commonwealth
OL,5,Cdebut
OL,7,FThe teenager, from Y Felinheli in
OL,8,FGwynedd, is bringing home Wales' first
OL,9,Fmedal of the games.
OL,11,FLetton-Jones has albinism, a condition
OL,12,Fthat severely affects her sight. This
OL,13,Fmeans she has to count her strokes to
OL,14,Fknow when the wall of the pool is
OL,15,Fapproaching.
OL,17,FSpeaking to ITV News, Ela described
OL,18,Fthe win as "meaning everything".
OL,20,FShe said: "I'm just running on
OL,21,Fadrenaline at the moment.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/3
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
