FL,434,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1785073676
OL,3,CPara-swimmer Ela Letton-Jones secures
OL,4,CWales' first medal in Commonwealth
OL,5,Cdebut
OL,7,F"It means everything, especially
OL,8,Fwinning a medal for Wales, because we
OL,9,Fnever really get to compete for Wales
OL,10,Fand I'm so glad.
OL,12,F"I'm really proud to be Welsh, and so
OL,13,FI'm glad I delivered and hope I made
OL,14,Fthe country proud."
OL,16,FEla Letton-Jones will be gearing up
OL,17,Ffor her next Commonwealth event, where
OL,18,Fshe will be swimming in the 50m
OL,19,Ffreestyle next Tuesday (28 July).
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/3
